  "exposure_record": "Original aggregate and destination results are exposed. Eighteen role candidates were selected from source context before per-member outcomes; reviewed UniProt annotations and original feature/metadata schemas were inspected. The other81 are explicitly unreviewed. No new member outcomes were computed before this freeze.",
