  "nesting_and_overlap": "Cells nest within mice; all three modules overlap and reuse one Strunz source. Role bins may overlap. No new independent replication is claimed.",
  "population_and_selection": "Exact original GSE141259 injured day2-21 cohort; exclude NC-prefix samples; raw UMI>=500 and >=30 cells per state; same24 eligible mice and all99 fixed genes.",
  "contrast": "Mouse-paired Krt8+ ADI minus AT2 activated expected gene detection at500 UMI; equal-mouse summaries.",
  "endpoint": "Per-member detection percentage-point change and each member contribution divided by its own module denominator99,57 or53; unchanged original aggregate reconstruction.",
  "methods": "Stream original Matrix Market counts with full-feature library totals. Compute hypergeometric detection expectation; retain all per-cell primitives and per-mouse gene values. Check exact roster/member/support parity,216 original unit/pair module reconstructions within1e-8pp, and independent synthetic hypergeometric probabilities.",
  "missingness_and_exclusions": "Do not fill missing genes, substitute functions or discard unfavorable members. Unknown81 role annotations stay explicit. Stop for source/count/ID/support/module/parity failures.",
  "multiplicity": "All99 genes and all three fixed modules retained alphabetically; no new inferential tests, ranking, replacement positive set or adjusted significance claims.",
  "precision_status": "not_applicable",
  "precision_basis": "This is attribution of an already exposed fixed descriptive aggregate. No new power, effect margin, population confidence interval or confirmatory test is invented.",
